# Monad RNG has no required runtime secrets or environment variables.
#
# The browser connects directly to the public Monad testnet RPC and to the
# user's injected wallet. Never put a wallet private key, seed phrase, relayer
# key, or server credential in this file.
#
# Optional deployment scripts accept only a public address here. Supply signing
# through an encrypted Foundry keystore, never through a raw private key.
# DEPLOYER_ADDRESS=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
# EXPECTED_CHAIN_ID=10143
